<type>(<scope>): <short imperative summary>

# SemVer mapping:
# feat:     minor release
# fix:      patch release
# feat!: or BREAKING CHANGE: major release
#
# Allowed types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
# Scope is optional and identifies the affected area, for example: auth, db, ui.
# Keep the summary in the imperative mood, lowercase, and without a trailing period.
# Add a blank line followed by details only when they add useful context.
# Use a BREAKING CHANGE: footer to describe incompatible behavior.
